--TEST--
The token walk descends into a type test, so the subject of `is` is coloured like any other read — `rule:ide/the-request-set-is-closed`
--FILE--
<?nvs
interface Shape
{
    public function area(): int;
}

class Square implements Shape
{
    public function area(): int { return 4; }
}

mixed $s = new Square();
if ($s is Shape) {
    echo $s->area();
}
--REQUEST--
semanticTokens
--EXPECT--
2:11+5 interface
4:21+4 method
7:7+6 class
7:25+5 interface
9:21+4 method
12:7+2 variable
12:16+6 class
13:5+2 variable
14:10+2 variable
14:14+4 method
